<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="TIT" style="id">- ZARAMO Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">TITO</para>
  <para style="toc1">LUPWILILI LWANDIKIGWE NA MTUMIGWA WA KILISTO PAULO HA TITO</para>
  <para style="toc2">TITO</para>
  <para style="toc3">Tit.</para>
  <para style="mt2">LUPWILILI LWANDIKIGWE NA MTUMIGWA WA KILISTO PAULO HA</para>
  <para style="mt1">TITO</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOZI</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu cha Tito kicho kitabu kili mmwanza wa mhwilili nne zilawa ha Paulo ziyamwandikile munhu imweimwe na sio ha dale jose da wanhu wamtogole Kilisto. Mhwilili ziyagwe ndatu zayandike Paulo ha munhu imweimwe zizo 1Timoteo, 2Timoteo, na Filimoni. Paulo kakala yamwandikile Tito ila vivija kandika kamba vija lupwilili luja lukala lulondigwa kusomigwa haulongozi wa wanhu bwando. Togatanga gano kwavija kalongelela mbuli zimtenda heyo yalumbe kuwa mtumigwa wa Kilisto, kinhu Tito kiyakalile yeshile kukimanya. Siku Paulo kandika lupwilili luno hagatigati ya milao ya 63-65 songela kuvumbuka kwa Kilisto.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulo kamulagiza Tito yawalongoze wanhu wamtogole Kilisto wakalile kukisiwa cha Kilete. Paulo kandika lupwilili luno giladi yamulagize Tito vija vondayawasagule na kuwafundiza vilangizi wa wanhu wamtogole Kilisto. Kamgwelela malagizo galingane na gaja gayalongile mulupwilili lwa Timoteo. Lupwilili lwake lolonga vija kilangizi wa wanhu wamtogole Kilisto vondawakale ukazi unogile na kuwa ningo ha wanhu wayagwe. Wanhu wamtogole Kilisto na vilangizi wao lelo wolondigwa kuzilola mbuli zino mwa awo wali muulongozi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali Mgati ya Ikitabu</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Paulo komulagiza Tito kusagula vilangizi wali na moyo wa kumdumba Mulungu (<char style="ior"><ref loc="TIT 1:1-16">1:1-16</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Abaho, vivija komulagiza Tito kuwafundiza wanhu wakale ukazi wa kumdumba Mulungu (<char style="ior"><ref loc="TIT 2:1-3:11">2:1—3:11</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Hakimambukizo, Paulo kokwishilizila mkulava ngelegeza zikalile mmoyo wake na kulava ndamsa (<char style="ior"><ref loc="TIT 3:12-15">3:12-15</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="TIT 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 1:1"/>Lupwilili luno lolawa ha Paulo, nyakadala wa Mulungu na mtumigwa wa Yesu Kilisto.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 1:1">Nitumigwa giladi niigangamize nhamanila ya awo wasaguligwe na Mulungu na kuwafundiza kuitanga ikweli yondaiwatende wakale ukazi wa kumnogeza Mulungu. <verse eid="TIT 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 1:2"/>Kweli ino iwatenda wawe na tamanilo da kuwa na ugima wa digunge, ugima awo Mulungu yalibule uvwizi uyekile kilagano nao songela ulumwengu haunalumbigwa. <verse eid="TIT 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 1:3"/>Na mkipigiti kitogoligwe kaigubula mbuli yake kubitila Usenga Unogile unigweleligwe nie, Usenga uniupeta mkushulutizwa na Mulungu Mkombola wetu.<verse eid="TIT 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 1:4"/>Nokwandikila gweye, Tito, mwanangu wa ikweli mnhamanila ituisangila.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 1:4">Ngekewa na tindiwalo kulawa ha Mulungu Tata na kulawa ha Yesu Kilisto Mkombola wetu viwe hamoja nagwe.<verse eid="TIT 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sang'hano ya Tito ako Kilete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 1:5"/>Nikuleka kuna ikisiwa cha Kilete giladi ukamambukize sang'hano yetu haja, na uwasagule wavyele wa wanhu wamtogole Kilisto m'viwambo vose vili na madale ga wanhu wamtogole Kilisto kamba vinikulongele. <verse eid="TIT 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 1:6"/>M'vyele kolondigwa sambiyatagusigwe mbuli na munhu yoyose, yawe na mtwanzi imwe, munhu mwene wana wamtogole Kilisto, sambiwawe watundu, wawe wanhu wa kuizuila mmbuli zihile. <verse eid="TIT 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 1:7"/>Kwavija m'vyele iyo mkulu muisang'hano ya Mulungu, avo kolondigwa sambiyawe na mbuli na munhu, sambiyawe na matopa, sambiyone lusango himahima, sambiyakoligwe, sambiyawe mkali, na sambiyaipatile vinhu mnzila ya uzenzeleganye, <verse eid="TIT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 1:8"/>ila kolondigwa kuwa mgomela wahenza, yonogelwa na ganogile, yawe na ng'hungwe, yawe bule uzenzeleganye, yang'alile, na mwene kuizuila sambiyatende gehile. <verse eid="TIT 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 1:9"/>Kolondigwa kuugoga ng'hani Usenga Unogile utogoligwa uyafundizwe, giladi yadahe kuwagangamiza wayage mkuwapetela mafundo gali na mhiko, na kuwalagusila awo wogabela haja hawahonyele.<verse eid="TIT 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 1:10"/>Kwavija kuna wanhu bwando wabezi awo wolonga mbuli za kibozi na kuwavwizila wayao, hasa waja wowagong'ondeza wanhu wengile kumbi kileka mana wakomboligwe. <verse eid="TIT 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 1:11"/>Wolondigwa wavudalizwe, kwavija sama ya mafundizo gao ga uvwizi wowagiza mulango wose. Wotenda gano sama ya kupata hela tu. <verse eid="TIT 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 1:12"/>Hata imwe wa wanhu zao wenyego, ayo womkema muhokozi kulawa kisiwa cha Kilete, kawalonga hewo yolonga, “Wanhu kulawa Kilete wose wavwizi, wang'onyo wene ukaini, wakoka, na wabukanyaji.” <verse eid="TIT 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 1:13"/>Na usindila uno una kweli mgati yake. Avo wakomhokele wanhu wamtogole Kilisto mkuwakalikila giladi wawe na nhamanila igangamale. <verse eid="TIT 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 1:14"/>Sambiwagendelele kutegeleza usheha wa Wayahudi ama malagizo gatendigwe na wanhu ga awo wailemile ikweli. <verse eid="TIT 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 1:15"/>Ha awo wang'alile, kila kinhu king'ala. Ila ha awo wanyolodoke na walekile kutogola, haduhu kinhu king'alile kumwao, kwavija nzewele zao na udaho wao wa kusambula gehile na ganogile zibanangika. <verse eid="TIT 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="TIT 1:16"/>Wolonga wamtanga Mulungu, ila sang'hano zao zobela. Hawanogelwa na wamema udulu, hawalumbile kutenda kinhu chochose kinogile.<verse eid="TIT 1:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="TIT 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Mafundizo Gali na Mhiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 2:1"/>Ila gweye, Tito, kolondigwa ufundize gaja gali mmafundizo gali na mhiko. <verse eid="TIT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 2:2"/>Wafundize wavyele wa kimbigalo waizuile, walumbe kuhishimilwa, na wawe na ng'hungwe. Wagangamale mnhamanila, mdinoge, na mkwazaganya. <verse eid="TIT 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 2:3"/>Vivija wafundize wavyele wa kitwanzi wakale mnzila imnogele Mulungu, sambiwawalonge wanhu vihile ama kuwa nyakadala wa ugimbi. Ila wawafundize wandele zao gaja ganogile. <verse eid="TIT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 2:4"/>Wavyele wa kitwanzi wolondigwa wawafundize wandele zao wawanogele wambigalo zao na wana zao, <verse eid="TIT 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 2:5"/>waizuile, wang'ale, wasang'hanike mkae zao, wawe na moyo unogile, na wawe wende ha wambigalo zao, giladi Usenga wa Mulungu sambiulongigwe vihile.<verse eid="TIT 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 2:6"/>Vivija walongeleni mkuwayalalila wamhale giladi waizuile. <verse eid="TIT 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 2:7"/>Gweye uwe ningo mkutenda vinhu vose vinogile. Mmafundizo gako, sambiuwe na uzenzeleganye, na usegeze kinyala. <verse eid="TIT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 2:8"/>Fundiza ikweli giladi mafundo gako sambigawe na ving'hwaso, abaho munhu yoyose yondayakubeze yone kinyala, yawe bule kinhu chochose kihile cha kutulonga tweye.<verse eid="TIT 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 2:9"/>Wafundize nyakadala wawe wende ha wandewa zao na kuwanogeza mkila kinhu, sambiwaibamilile nao <verse eid="TIT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 2:10"/>ama kuwebila, ila walaguse kamba mazua gose hewo wanoga na wabule uzenzeleganye, giladi mnzila zose wagatende mafundo ga Mulungu Mkombola wetu goneke ganoga.<verse eid="TIT 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 2:11"/>Kwavija ngekewa ya Mulungu igala ukombola igubuligwa ha wanhu wose. <verse eid="TIT 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 2:12"/>Ngekewa hiyo yotufundiza kuleka kukala ukazi wa kumgevuza Mulungu, kuleka sulukila za muulumwengu, na kukala ukazi wa kuizuila, kuwa bule uzenzeleganye, na kumnogeza Mulungu muulumwengu uno. <verse eid="TIT 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 2:13"/>Kuno tobeta zua dimotezwe ditutamanila, kipigiti Mulungu wetu Mkulu na Mkombola wetu Yesu Kilisto vondayoneke na yenzi yake. <verse eid="TIT 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 2:14"/>Kailava mwenyego sama yetu tweye giladi yatukombole kulawa mmbuli zose zihile na kuwang'aliza wanhu zake sama yake mwenyego wawe na sulukila ya kutenda ganogile.<verse eid="TIT 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 2:15"/>Avo mbuli zino zizo zondaufundize. Uwagangamize wanhu na uwakomhokele na udaho wako wose. Sambiumuleke munhu yoyose yakuzabuze.<verse eid="TIT 2:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="TIT 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Kutenda Ganogile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 3:1"/>Wakumbuse wanhu wawe wende ha watawala na wali na udaho na sambiwawadulukile, ila waisasale kutenda mbuli zose zinogile. <verse eid="TIT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 3:2"/>Walongele sambiwamulonge vihile munhu yoyose, sambiwagombe, ila wahole na wawe na moyo unogile ha wanhu wose. <verse eid="TIT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 3:3"/>Umwaka tweye wenyego tukala wabozi, wadulu, tupotele, na nyakadala wa sulukila bwando zihile na za uhondo wa muulumwengu. Tukala ukazi wa kuilondela gehile na mkuiyonela migongo, wanhu wayagwe watwihila, na tweye tuihila wenyego kwa wenyego. <verse eid="TIT 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 3:4"/>Ila unozi na noge da Mulungu Mkombola wetu vuvigubuligwe, <verse eid="TIT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 3:5"/>katukombola, si sama ya vinhu vinogile vitutendile, ila sama ya bazi jake. Katukombola kubitila Loho wa Mulungu, ayo yatutendile tuvumbuke mwanza wa ikabili na kutugalula kuwa wa sambi mkutusuluza. <verse eid="TIT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 3:6"/>Mulungu katwitila Loho wake<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Mulungu katwitila Loho wake </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Mulungu katugwelela Loho wake.</char></note> bila mhima kubitila Yesu Kilisto Mkombola wetu, <verse eid="TIT 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 3:7"/>giladi tupetigwe na Mulungu kuwa wanhu walibule uzenzeleganye kubitila ngekewa yake na kuwa wahazi wa ugima wa digunge utuutamanila. <verse eid="TIT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 3:8"/>Mbuli zino zinilongile si za uvwizi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 3:8">Nokulonda gweye ugazamize mafundo gano, giladi awo wamtogole Mulungu walamule wenyego kutenda ganogile. Mafundo gano ganoga na gomzenga kila munhu. <verse eid="TIT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 3:9"/>Ila uinege na mbamila za kibozi, simulizi za misululu ya wahenga, ngomba, na kuisuna sama ya Malagizo ga Musa. Mbuli zino hazizenga na za kibozi. <verse eid="TIT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 3:10"/>Munhu yoyose yogala mbagu mmwanza wenu, mzume mianza mibili, abaho kamba hakuhulike, muleke. <verse eid="TIT 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 3:11"/>Uvitange kamba wanhu kamba wano hawali muna ikweli, na vilozo vao vowatagusa kamba wahonyela.<verse eid="TIT 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndagizi za Kimambukizo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 3:12"/>Notamanila kumtuma Atema ama Tikiko kumwako. Yahavika tu, tenda vuudahile wize tuiting'hane kudiwambo da Nikapoli, kwavija nokala haja kipigiti chose cha kihuhe. <verse eid="TIT 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 3:13"/>Tenda vuudahile umtaze Zena yagatangile goya malagizo na Apolo giladi wasonge mwanza wao, na uwagwelele kila kinhu chowolonda. <verse eid="TIT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 3:14"/>Na wanhu zetu wamtogole Kilisto waifundize kusang'hanika bila kushulutizwa na munhu, giladi wapate vinhu viwolonda mazua gose na sambiwakale bila kutenda sang'hano yoyose.<verse eid="TIT 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 3:15"/>Wanhu wose wali hamoja na nie wokulamsa. Walamse mbwiga zetu mnhamanila.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 3:15">Ngekewa ya Mulungu iwe na mweye mose.<verse eid="TIT 3:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 3"/>
</usx>
